egory":"nature","address":"知多郡阿久比町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"23441","municipality_pref":"愛知県","municipality_name":"阿久比町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[136.91321398,34.92590781]}}],"display_comment_original":"阿久比町周辺には、近世村の記憶として稗之宮村、椋原村、角岡村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡、産業施設に関わる場所が見え、坂部城跡、東光寺、東光寺のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では稗之宮村、椋原村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["松平定勝","久松俊勝","松平康元","松平康俊"],"notable_people":["松平定勝","久松俊勝","松平康元","松平康俊","岡戸半蔵"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["坂部城跡","宮津城跡","洞雲院","正盛院","蓮慶寺","平泉寺","二子塚古墳（ふたごづかこふん）","板山長根古窯"],"specialties":["ヘイケボタル","アコヤガイ"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E4%B9%85%E6%AF%94%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3136471","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11369424","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q10729352","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q10729351","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11473032","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11598905","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11643796","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%9D%BE%E5%B9%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%8B%9D&keyword=%E9%98%BF%E4%B9%85%E6%AF%94%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"阿久比町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110348937","wikidata_qid":"Q1203868","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E4%B9%85%E6%AF%94%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%9D%BE%E5%B9%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%8B%9D&keyword=%E9%98%BF%E4%B9%85%E6%AF%94%E7%94%BA","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}